    # ARWEN @ talk "Tell me darling, who in all of Mirnos would you want to talk about them... when {i}I'm{/i} by your side?"
    ARWEN @ talk "告诉我亲爱的，当{i}我{/i}在你身边时，整个米尔诺斯还有谁值得你谈论呢？"

# game/data/characters/arwen/scr_dialogue.rpy:15
translate zh dialogue_arwen_othergirls_menu_f72c231a:

    # ARWEN @ talk "Well... Now you're speaking a girls favourite language!"
    ARWEN @ talk "嗯...现在你可是说到女孩最喜欢听到的话了！"

# game/data/characters/arwen/scr_dialogue.rpy:17
translate zh dialogue_arwen_othergirls_menu_ab602309:

    # ARWEN @ talk "Was there someone specific you wanted to ask about?"
    ARWEN @ talk "有特别想打听的人吗？"

# game/data/characters/arwen/scr_dialogue.rpy:20
translate zh dialogue_arwen_othergirls_menu_paid_5c4b33c4:

    # ARWEN @ angry "Hm? Oh, {i}her{/i} I'd avoid her if I was you."
    ARWEN @ angry "嗯？哦，{i}她{/i}啊，如果我是你我会避开她。"

# game/data/characters/arwen/scr_dialogue.rpy:21
translate zh dialogue_arwen_othergirls_menu_paid_d42b7565:

    # ARWEN @ angry "Overpriced to put it mildly, you'd think she was a virgin princess with how highly she views herself."
    ARWEN @ angry "说轻点是定价过高，她那自视甚高的样子会让你以为她是个处女公主。"

# game/data/characters/arwen/scr_dialogue.rpy:22
translate zh dialogue_arwen_othergirls_menu_paid_1950d15a:

    # ARWEN @ blush "Don't worry though, I'll show you what a {i}real{/i} woman can do."
    ARWEN @ blush "不过别担心，我会让你见识{i}真正{/i}的女人能做什么。"

# game/data/characters/arwen/scr_dialogue.rpy:25
translate zh dialogue_arwen_othergirls_menu_paid_77c1d01c:

    # ARWEN @ think "Hmm, nice enough girl."
    ARWEN @ think "嗯，是个不错的姑娘。"

# game/data/characters/arwen/scr_dialogue.rpy:26
translate zh dialogue_arwen_othergirls_menu_paid_879dd5c5:

    # ARWEN @ talk "But I think she's a little {i}too{/i} desperate to work in here."
    ARWEN @ talk "但我觉得她{i}太{/i}渴望在这里工作了。"

# game/data/characters/arwen/scr_dialogue.rpy:27
translate zh dialogue_arwen_othergirls_menu_paid_35cb4a19:

    # ARWEN @ talk "As far as I know, they let her stay and serve clients outside for a reduced rate, but I doubt she'll get through the door."
    ARWEN @ talk "据我所知，他们让她留在外面以折扣价接客，但我怀疑她进不了这个门。"

# game/data/characters/arwen/scr_dialogue.rpy:28
translate zh dialogue_arwen_othergirls_menu_paid_da22f4ce:

    # MC @ talk "Why's that?"
    MC @ talk "为什么？"

# game/data/characters/arwen/scr_dialogue.rpy:29
translate zh dialogue_arwen_othergirls_menu_paid_8e2a16c2:

    # ARWEN @ talk "Look around you, we're not the {i}Black Diamond,{/i} we general serve adventurers and merchants with coin to burn."
    ARWEN @ talk "看看周围，我们不是{i}黑钻石{/i}那种地方，我们主要服务挥金如土的冒险者和商人。"

# game/data/characters/arwen/scr_dialogue.rpy:30
translate zh dialogue_arwen_othergirls_menu_paid_e4fcf857:

    # ARWEN @ talk "And she's out there letting the city guard take put it in her ass behind a wall... Hardly a good fit."
    ARWEN @ talk "而她却在墙后让城市卫兵走后门...实在不太合适。"

# game/data/characters/arwen/scr_dialogue.rpy:31
translate zh dialogue_arwen_othergirls_menu_paid_33eafac5:

    # MC @ talk "That seems rather harsh..."
    MC @ talk "这似乎有点苛刻..."

# game/data/characters/arwen/scr_dialogue.rpy:32
translate zh dialogue_arwen_othergirls_menu_paid_8c61c9e1:

    # ARWEN @ talk "It's just business darling... it's always cut-throat, no matter the trade."
    ARWEN @ talk "这只是生意，亲爱的...无论什么行业，竞争总是残酷的。"

# game/data/characters/arwen/scr_dialogue.rpy:35
translate zh dialogue_arwen_othergirls_menu_paid_480f5c90:

    # ARWEN @ talk "Alright then, was there something else?"
    ARWEN @ talk "好吧，还有什么想问的吗？"

